// Flutter App FVM Rules

// ============================================================
// FLUTTER VERSION MANAGEMENT (FVM) RULES — ALWAYS ENFORCE
// ============================================================
//
// 1. ALWAYS use `fvm flutter` instead of `flutter` for all CLI commands.
// 2. ALWAYS use `fvm dart` instead of `dart` for all CLI commands.
// 3. DO NOT run standard `flutter pub get` or `flutter run`. ALWAYS prefix with `fvm`.
// 4. The required Flutter version for this project is strictly defined in the `.fvmrc` file.
// 5. Ensure the IDE is configured to use the `.fvm/flutter_sdk` path.
